<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-row">
      <view class="hero-mark">
        <ui-icon name="folder" size="40" color="#4B6EF5"></ui-icon>
      </view>
      <view class="grow">
        <text class="eyebrow">ADMIN</text>
        <text class="hero-title">课程归档上传</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="hero-sub">上传 TXT / MD / JSON 目录，或按「分类-课题.docx」命名的文件。系统先抽出标题和分类，再按智学内置目录对齐原题；对上的用智能体原题归档，对不上的仍按抽出的标题入库，点课把该标题发给智学。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">1. 上传课题文件</view>
    <view class="muted">可多选。文件名如「0-3岁课程-听懂婴语.docx」会拆出分类和标题，并尝试对齐智学「听懂“婴语”：…」原题。TXT / MD / JSON 会读正文目录。Word / PDF 读不到正文，请靠文件名或下方粘贴目录。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onChoose" disabled="{{submitting}}">选择文件（可多选）</button>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{files.length}}">已选 {{files.length}} 个</view>
    <view class="file-row" wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="name">
      <text class="desc">{{item.name}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">2. 或粘贴分类目录 / 全文</view>
    <view class="muted">按分类列出课题原题（Markdown 也可），会一次归档多门课。若只贴一篇教案全文，则作为一门课解析标题。</view>
    <textarea
      class="area"
      placeholder="## 0-3岁课程&#10;1. 课题原题一&#10;2. 课题原题二"
      value="{{text}}"
      bindinput="onText"
      maxlength="20000"
      auto-height
    ></textarea>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">本批默认分类（文件名里已有分类时以文件名为准）</view>
    <input class="field" placeholder="例如：0-3岁课程" value="{{category}}" bindinput="onCategory" />
    <scroll-view scroll-x class="cats" wx:if="{{categories.length}}">
      <view
        class="cat {{category === item ? 'on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{categories}}"
        wx:key="*this"
        data-name="{{item}}"
        bindtap="onPickCategory"
      >{{item}}</view>
    </scroll-view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{progress}}">{{progress}}</view>
    <button class="btn" bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{submitting}}">{{submitting ? '归档中…' : '分析并归档到目录'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{preview.length}}">
    <view class="title">本次将归档 {{preview.length}} 门</view>
    <view class="muted">已对齐智学 {{matchedCount}} 门 · 未匹配 {{unmatchedCount}} 门（未匹配仍归档，点课发送抽出的标题）</view>
    <view class="file-row" wx:for="{{preview}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="grow">
        <view class="desc">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.category || '未标注分类'}}</view>
        <view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.matched && item.sourceTitle && item.sourceTitle !== item.title}}">文件标题：{{item.sourceTitle}}</view>
      </view>
      <text class="chip {{item.matched ? '' : 'chip-warn'}}">{{item.matched ? '已对齐智学' : '未匹配'}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{lastResult}}">
    <view class="title">上次归档</view>
    <view class="desc">新增 {{lastResult.inserted}} 门（对齐智学 {{lastResult.matchedCount}} 门），目录现有 {{lastResult.catalogCount}} 门 / {{lastResult.categoryCount}} 类。</view>
    <button class="btn" bindtap="onGoCatalog">去课程目录点课学习</button>
  </view>
</view>
